sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant F as Frontend
  participant A as API
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant E as Engine
  U->>F: Ask question / upload file
  F->>A: Authenticated request
  A->>O: Intent + policy context
  O->>E: Verified deterministic operation
  E-->>O: Result + metadata
  O-->>A: Explanation and status
  A-->>F: JSON response
  F-->>U: Render answer
